Important points
express() → creates the Express application.
express.Router() → creates a router for defining API routes.
app.use('/api', router) → mounts the router under /api.
router.get() → handles GET requests.
router.post() → handles POST requests.
req → contains the incoming request.
res → used to send the response.
res.json() → sends a response in JSON format.
/api/users → endpoint for getting users.
/api/users/add → endpoint for adding a user
